## The `Units.Astronomy` module of §8.20.
##
## The astronomy units are ambient `Unit[d]` values from the kernel's unit
## table (§5.1); see `Units.SI`'s header for why no binding is declared here.
## The table itself: `au` (exact), `ly`, `pc` (prefixable, so `Mpc` works),
## `Rsun`, `Msun`, `Mearth`, `jup`.
module Units.Astronomy
